#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:1
msgid "Read A Fragment Interaction Report"
msgstr "阅读片段相互作用能报告"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:3
msgid ""
"This page is for experimental partners. You do not run q2m3 or write code. The computational side"
" runs the workflow and sends you a Markdown report. The report is in Chinese. This page explains "
"each section of one real report."
msgstr "本页面向实验方合作者。你不需要运行 q2m3，也不需要写代码。计算方运行工作流，然后把一份 Markdown 报告发给你。报告用中文书写。本页逐节解读一份真实报告。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:7
msgid "The Example Report"
msgstr "示例报告"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:9
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The example report comes from the water-dimer run in [Fragment Interaction Energy](fragment-"
"interaction.md). That run uses the mode `full` and the cc-pVDZ basis. Download the report: "
"{download}`water-dimer-report.md`."
msgstr ""
"示例报告来自[片段相互作用能](fragment-interaction.md)中的水二聚体运行。该运行使用 `full` 模式与 cc-pVDZ 基组。下载报告：{download"
"}`water-dimer-report.md`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:18
msgid "Title And Fixed Statement"
msgstr "标题与固定说明"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:20
msgid ""
"Every report starts with the title `片段相互作用能报告` (fragment interaction energy report) and the fixed"
" statement `q2m3 不对 Ks 做统计结论。`. The statement means that q2m3 draws no statistical conclusion "
"about Ks. q2m3 has no code that computes a correlation coefficient or a p-value."
msgstr ""
"每份报告都以标题 `片段相互作用能报告` 和固定说明 `q2m3 不对 Ks 做统计结论。` 开头。这句说明的意思是：q2m3 不对 Ks 得出任何统计结论。q2m3 中没有计算相关系数或 p "
"值的代码。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:25
msgid ""
"One report covers all fragment results of one call. Each fragment has its own section. The "
"section heading gives the fragment name, the mode, and the basis, for example `片段 water-dimer（模式 "
"full，基组 cc-pvdz）`."
msgstr "一份报告覆盖一次调用的全部片段结果。每个片段有自己的一节。节标题给出片段名、模式与基组，例如 `片段 water-dimer（模式 full，基组 cc-pvdz）`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:29
msgid "Interaction Energy"
msgstr "相互作用能"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:31
msgid ""
"The table `相互作用能 ΔE（counterpoise 校正）` has one row for each method layer. ΔE is E(AB) − E(A) − "
"E(B). AB is the dimer, and A and B are the two fragments. The three energies use the dimer basis,"
" which is the counterpoise correction. A negative ΔE means that the dimer has a lower energy than"
" the two separate fragments."
msgstr ""
"表 `相互作用能 ΔE（counterpoise 校正）` 中每个方法层占一行。ΔE 等于 E(AB) − E(A) − E(B)。AB 是二聚体，A 与 B "
"是两个片段。三个能量都用二聚体基组计算，这就是 counterpoise 校正。ΔE 为负，表示二聚体的能量低于两个分开的片段。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:14
msgid "Layer"
msgstr "层"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:14
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:14
msgid "HF"
msgstr "HF"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:14
msgid "Hartree–Fock"
msgstr "Hartree–Fock"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:14
msgid "MP2"
msgstr "MP2"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:14
msgid "Second-order Møller–Plesset perturbation theory with a frozen core"
msgstr "冻结芯的二阶 Møller–Plesset 微扰理论"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:14
msgid "CASCI"
msgstr "CASCI"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:14
msgid "Exact diagonalization in the active space"
msgstr "活性空间内的精确对角化"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:14
msgid "SQD"
msgstr "SQD"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:14
msgid "Sample-based quantum diagonalization in the same active space"
msgstr "同一活性空间内的基于采样的量子对角化"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:14
msgid "CCSD(T)"
msgstr "CCSD(T)"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:14
msgid "Coupled cluster with a frozen core in the full orbital space"
msgstr "全轨道空间内冻结芯的耦合簇方法"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:45
msgid ""
"Each energy has two columns: Ha with six decimals and kcal/mol with three decimals. A layer "
"without a value shows `—`, and the column `空值原因` (reason for the empty value) gives the reason. "
"The mode `classical_only` gives only the HF and MP2 layers."
msgstr "每个能量占两列：Ha 保留 6 位小数，kcal/mol 保留 3 位小数。没有值的层显示 `—`，`空值原因` 列给出原因。`classical_only` 模式只给出 HF 与 MP2 两层。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:50
msgid "In the example report, the five layers are between −3.935 and −3.557 kcal/mol."
msgstr "示例报告中，5 层的值在 −3.935 与 −3.557 kcal/mol 之间。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:52
msgid "Error Decomposition"
msgstr "误差分解"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:54
msgid ""
"The table `误差分解` (error decomposition) has four rows. Each row gives the signed value and the "
"absolute value, in Ha and in kcal/mol."
msgstr "表 `误差分解` 有 4 行。每行给出有符号值与绝对值，单位为 Ha 与 kcal/mol。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:14
msgid "Row"
msgstr "行"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:14
msgid "Definition"
msgstr "定义"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:14
msgid "Example report"
msgstr "示例报告"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:14
msgid "`算法误差` (algorithm error)"
msgstr "`算法误差`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:14
msgid "SQD − CASCI"
msgstr "SQD − CASCI"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:14
msgid "0.016 kcal/mol"
msgstr "0.016 kcal/mol"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:14
msgid "`活性空间误差` (active-space error)"
msgstr "`活性空间误差`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:14
msgid "CASCI − same-basis full-space reference"
msgstr "CASCI − 同基组全空间参考"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:14
msgid "0.125 kcal/mol"
msgstr "0.125 kcal/mol"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:14
msgid "`基组误差` (basis error)"
msgstr "`基组误差`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:14
msgid "Same-basis full-space reference − external reference"
msgstr "同基组全空间参考 − 外部参考"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:14
msgid "Empty"
msgstr "空"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:14
msgid "`模型误差` (model error)"
msgstr "`模型误差`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:14
msgid "Active-space error + basis error"
msgstr "活性空间误差 + 基组误差"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:64
msgid ""
"The line `同基组全空间参考来源：pyscf_ccsd_t` names the source of the same-basis full-space reference. In "
"the example report, the source is the CCSD(T) layer of the same run. The basis error and the "
"model error need an external reference, which the computational side imports. The example run had"
" no external reference, so the two rows are empty with the reason `missing external reference`."
msgstr ""
"`同基组全空间参考来源：pyscf_ccsd_t` 这一行给出同基组全空间参考的来源。示例报告中，来源是同一次运行的 CCSD(T) "
"层。基组误差与模型误差需要外部参考，外部参考由计算方导入。示例运行没有外部参考，所以这两行为空，原因是 `missing external reference`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:71
msgid "Resource Estimates"
msgstr "资源估计"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:73
msgid "The last two tables of each fragment section are planning data, not energies."
msgstr "每个片段一节的最后两张表是规划数据，不是能量。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:75
msgid ""
"`双因子分解成本估计（QPE 资源）`: a double-factorization cost estimate of quantum phase estimation (QPE) for "
"the active-space Hamiltonian of AB, A, and B. The columns are λ in Ha, logical qubits, and "
"Toffoli gates. The table is an estimate, not the result of a QPE circuit."
msgstr ""
"`双因子分解成本估计（QPE 资源）`：对 AB、A、B 的活性空间哈密顿量做量子相位估计（QPE）的双因子分解成本估计。列为 λ（单位 Ha）、逻辑比特与 Toffoli "
"门数。该表是估计值，不是 QPE 线路的运行结果。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:79
msgid ""
"`SQD 工作量与内存预估`: the qubits (two for each active orbital), the full CI dimension of the active "
"space, and the predicted peak memory (RSS, in decimal MB) of the two SQD stages, prepare and "
"sample."
msgstr "`SQD 工作量与内存预估`：量子比特数（每个活性轨道 2 个）、活性空间的全 CI 维数，以及 SQD 两个阶段（prepare 与 sample）的峰值内存（RSS，十进制 MB）预估。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:83
msgid "You can skip these two tables when you compare the energies with experiments."
msgstr "把能量与实验对照时，可以跳过这两张表。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:85
msgid "Experimental Ks Values"
msgstr "实验 Ks 值"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:87
msgid ""
"You can give the computational side a table of experimental labels and Ks values. The "
"computational side passes the table to `render_report` as `ks_table`. The report then ends with "
"the section `实验 Ks 值（只并列显示）` (experimental Ks values, listed side by side only). The section has "
"this form:"
msgstr ""
"你可以把一张实验标签与 Ks 值的表交给计算方。计算方把这张表作为 `ks_table` 传给 `render_report`。报告末尾随后增加 `实验 Ks 值（只并列显示）` "
"一节。该节的格式如下："

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-report.md:100
msgid ""
"The rows keep the order in which the computational side passes them. q2m3 does not compute a "
"correlation, a fit, or a p-value from these values. Any comparison between ΔE and Ks is your own "
"analysis. The example report has no such section because its run had no Ks table."
msgstr "各行的顺序与计算方传入的顺序相同。q2m3 不从这些值计算相关性、拟合或 p 值。ΔE 与 Ks 之间的任何对照都是你自己的分析。示例报告没有这一节，因为它的运行没有 Ks 表。"
